1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,497
Watch the Daniell cell.

2
00:00:01,497 --> 00:00:10,299
As the cell runs, zinc ions pile up and copper ions are used, so Q rises, and the E M F slowly falls.

3
00:00:10,299 --> 00:00:18,242
Run it long enough, and Q reaches K, the E M F reaches zero, and the battery is flat.

